{"id":"perfect-gerund-infinitive","lv":"b2","n":19,"cat":"verb-patterns","t":"Having done, to have done: việc đã xảy ra trước","en":"He denied having… · She seems to have left.","sum":"Nhấn mạnh việc xảy ra TRƯỚC. Having + V3 đứng ở chỗ cần dạng -ing, sau deny, admit, regret, sau giới từ: I deny having touched it. He regrets having quit his job. To have + V3 đứng ở chỗ cần to V, sau seem, appear, be said / believed: You seem to have forgotten. Would love / like / hate to have + V3 = tiếc vì đã không được: I'd love to have tried it. Khi thứ tự đã rõ (admit, deny), dạng thường là đủ và tự nhiên hơn: He admitted taking it.","forms":[{"f":"having + V3 = đã làm (trước đó)","vi":"He denied having eaten the cake."},{"f":"seem / appear + to have + V3","vi":"She seems to have left."},{"f":"would love + to have + V3 = tiếc vì không được","vi":"I'd love to have seen it."},{"f":"thứ tự đã rõ → dạng thường cũng đủ","vi":"He admitted taking it."}],"pts":[{"id":"perfect-infinitive-gerund","name":"Perfect infinitive & gerund","vi":"Having done / to have done: việc xảy ra trước"}],"cast":{"ana":{"name":{"en":"Ana","vi":"Ana"},"look":"woman","style":{"outfit":"jacket","top":"#8C3B4A","topShade":"#76303D","accent":"#A23B55","hair":"curly","hairColor":"#2B1D18","skin":"#8D5A3C","skinShade":"#784A30"},"x":560},"jay":{"name":{"en":"Jay","vi":"Jay"},"look":"man","style":{"outfit":"apron","top":"#2E2E2E","topShade":"#222222","accent":"#707070","hair":"short","hairColor":"#1F1B1A","skin":"#A86F4C","skinShade":"#93603F"},"x":1040}},"bg":"restaurant","props":[{"id":"cake","x":820}],"beats":[{"k":"e","sec":"hook","en":"Jay, somebody ate half of the new cake!","vi":"Jay ơi, có người ăn mất nửa cái bánh mới rồi!","ipa":["dʒeɪ","ˈsʌmˌbɑdi","eɪt","hæf","ʌv","ðə","nu","keɪk"],"who":"ana","ann":{"expression":"angry","prop":"cake"},"b":1,"start":0.476,"end":2.496,"timing":[[0,0.476],[1,0.699],[2,1.161],[3,1.324],[4,1.611],[5,1.723],[6,1.824],[7,2.036]]},{"k":"e","sec":"hook","en":"Don't look at me. I deny having touched it!","vi":"Đừng nhìn tôi. Tôi khẳng định là chưa hề động vào nó!","ipa":["doʊnt","lʊk","æt","mi","aɪ","dɪˈnaɪ","ˈhævɪŋ","tʌtʃt","ɪt"],"who":"jay","ann":{"expression":"shy"},"b":1,"start":3.286,"end":6.286,"timing":[[0,3.286],[1,3.448],[2,3.629],[3,3.725],[4,4.853],[5,5.021],[6,5.406],[7,5.73],[8,6.091]]},{"k":"e","sec":"hook","en":"Hmm. You seem to have forgotten to clean your mouth.","vi":"Hừm. Hình như anh quên lau miệng rồi.","ipa":["hm","ju","sim","tu","hæv","fɚˈɡɑtən","tu","klin","jɔɹ","maʊθ"],"who":"ana","ann":{"expression":"thinking","gesture":"point"},"b":1,"start":7.076,"end":9.826,"timing":[[0,7.076],[1,7.684],[2,7.784],[3,8.059],[4,8.171],[5,8.309],[6,8.759],[7,8.884],[8,9.159],[9,9.296]]},{"k":"e","sec":"hook","en":"Oh... I seem to have eaten a little piece.","vi":"Ồ... Hình như tôi có ăn một miếng nhỏ.","ipa":["oʊ","aɪ","sim","tu","hæv","ˈitən","ə","ˈlɪtəl","pis"],"who":"jay","ann":{"expression":"shy"},"b":1,"start":10.616,"end":13.446,"timing":[[0,10.616],[1,11.724],[2,11.904],[3,12.157],[4,12.241],[5,12.385],[6,12.638],[7,12.71],[8,12.938]]},{"k":"n","sec":"hook","parts":[{"e":"Having touched"},{"v":": dạng "},{"e":"ing"},{"v":" hoàn thành, nói về việc đã xảy ra trước lúc nói. "},{"e":"You seem to have forgotten"},{"v":": dạng nguyên thể hoàn thành, tức "},{"e":"to have"},{"v":" cộng phân từ, đứng sau "},{"e":"seem"},{"v":"."}],"b":1,"start":14.086,"end":26.406},{"k":"n","sec":"form","parts":[{"v":"Cả hai dạng đều nhấn mạnh: việc này xảy ra trước. "},{"e":"Having"},{"v":" đứng ở chỗ cần dạng "},{"e":"ing"},{"v":". "},{"e":"To have"},{"v":" đứng ở chỗ cần dạng "},{"e":"to"},{"v":"."}],"b":2,"start":27.396,"end":36.406},{"k":"e","sec":"examples","en":"He regrets having quit his job.","vi":"Anh ấy hối hận vì đã bỏ việc.","ipa":["hi","ɹɪˈɡɹɛts","ˈhævɪŋ","kwɪt","hɪz","dʒɑb"],"hl":[[3,10,"k"],[11,22,"v"]],"b":3,"start":37.296,"end":39.006,"timing":[[0,37.296],[1,37.351],[2,37.813],[3,38.139],[4,38.376],[5,38.551]]},{"k":"e","sec":"examp